
# NovaPods Product Landing Page

## About the Project
NovaPods is a responsive product landing page
designed to showcase wireless earbuds.

## Features
- Navigation bar
- Hero section with product image
- Product features and benefits
- Customer reviews
- Call-to-action section
- Footer with contact information
- Responsive layout for mobile and desktop

## Technologies Used
- HTML5
- CSS3
- Flexbox
- CSS Grid
- Media Queries

## How to Run
1. Download or clone this repository.
2. Open index.html in a web browser.

## Project Purpose
This project was created as a Web Development
Week 02 Minor Project to practise responsive
web design and CSS layouts.
